        "detailed_description": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >《Late Ming: Reborn in Flames》is a 2D open-world visual novel game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948550/extras/04e21aa901df528fa0ab3f4bd10aeb49.avif?t=1787304520\" width=1332 height=592 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, you play as Wei Xie, a young man who travels back to the tumultuous final years of the Ming Dynasty. Navigate between powerful factions, complete quests, and build relationships with characters to unlock their storylines—ultimately deepening your bonds with them and uncovering their secrets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948550/extras/2313867ef84e90b6072a8411a1bcbb20.avif?t=1787304520\" width=1332 height=592 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948550/extras/45dfcb6f52e3b49f5c9d110c12ece5b2.avif?t=1787304520\" width=1332 height=592 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in this era of chaos and intrigue as you experience Wei Xie’s intertwined fate with each character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948550/extras/d18a4e7cbd1f4ea1f32002714e908043.avif?t=1787304520\" width=1332 height=592 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your stronghold to face the challenges of the chaotic late Ming era; cultivate the land and gather confidantes representing diverse regional styles and charms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948550/extras/853a342dfc76ec16e521ff4443620a0f.avif?t=1787304520\" width=1200 height=340 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your facilities and build your own commercial empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948550/extras/2ce4e4bcf101cee4a2934731d1fc014c.avif?t=1787304520\" width=1200 height=340 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assemble your own troops to defend your homeland and challenge rival factions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948550/extras/7372f20135f4038a5a20f0ed7ed8f805.avif?t=1787304520\" width=1200 height=340 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock various story chapters through your efforts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948550/extras/8add482317b4708624a157fac7ab1b08.avif?t=1787304520\" width=1544 height=261 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beware! Don’t miss the hidden storylines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948550/extras/54826b5dbf9f3985a3e2de5a58bfd1cf.poster.avif?t=1787304520\" width=900 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948550/extras/54826b5dbf9f3985a3e2de5a58bfd1cf.webm?t=1787304520\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948550/extras/54826b5dbf9f3985a3e2de5a58bfd1cf.mp4?t=1787304520\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discord：（ ）</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > QQ1群：192432995（满），QQ2群：456114765（满），QQ3群：1067279908（满），</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >QQ4群：723821005，QQ5群：1087080800</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >《Late Ming: Reborn in Flames》is a 2D open-world visual novel game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948550/extras/04e21aa901df528fa0ab3f4bd10aeb49.avif?t=1787304520\" width=1332 height=592 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, you play as Wei Xie, a young man who travels back to the tumultuous final years of the Ming Dynasty. Navigate between powerful factions, complete quests, and build relationships with characters to unlock their storylines—ultimately deepening your bonds with them and uncovering their secrets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948550/extras/2313867ef84e90b6072a8411a1bcbb20.avif?t=1787304520\" width=1332 height=592 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948550/extras/45dfcb6f52e3b49f5c9d110c12ece5b2.avif?t=1787304520\" width=1332 height=592 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in this era of chaos and intrigue as you experience Wei Xie’s intertwined fate with each character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948550/extras/d18a4e7cbd1f4ea1f32002714e908043.avif?t=1787304520\" width=1332 height=592 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your stronghold to face the challenges of the chaotic late Ming era; cultivate the land and gather confidantes representing diverse regional styles and charms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948550/extras/853a342dfc76ec16e521ff4443620a0f.avif?t=1787304520\" width=1200 height=340 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your facilities and build your own commercial empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948550/extras/2ce4e4bcf101cee4a2934731d1fc014c.avif?t=1787304520\" width=1200 height=340 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assemble your own troops to defend your homeland and challenge rival factions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948550/extras/7372f20135f4038a5a20f0ed7ed8f805.avif?t=1787304520\" width=1200 height=340 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock various story chapters through your efforts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948550/extras/8add482317b4708624a157fac7ab1b08.avif?t=1787304520\" width=1544 height=261 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beware! Don’t miss the hidden storylines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948550/extras/54826b5dbf9f3985a3e2de5a58bfd1cf.poster.avif?t=1787304520\" width=900 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948550/extras/54826b5dbf9f3985a3e2de5a58bfd1cf.webm?t=1787304520\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948550/extras/54826b5dbf9f3985a3e2de5a58bfd1cf.mp4?t=1787304520\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discord：（ ）</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > QQ1群：192432995（满），QQ2群：456114765（满），QQ3群：1067279908（满），</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >QQ4群：723821005，QQ5群：1087080800</p></li></ul>",
